                          "Name": "DMDemandFunction",
                          "ResourceName": null,
                          "Children": [
                            {
                              "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                              "Text": "\nDM demand is based on a simple partitioning coefficients.  At harvest the biomass partitioned to the stover = TotalDM * (1 - RootProportion) * (1 - Harvest index).  However the partitioningFraction is more complicated that this as it partitions more biomass to the stover in the CanopyExpanding Phase and less in the Yield increasing phase to give realistic patterns of accumulation of biomass in the Stover and Product over the duration of the crop\n",
                              "Name": "Description",
                              "ResourceName": null,
                              "Children": [],
                              "Enabled": true,
                              "ReadOnly": false
                            },
