                        {
                          "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                          "Text": "### Notes about this factor\r\n\r\n\r\n_Rogerio Cichota_  \r\n\r\nEyre_23a3 is a Weathered Orthic Recent soil  \nDarnley_4a2 is a Typic Argillic Pallic Soil  \nWaikiwi_33a2 is a Typic Firm Brown Soil  \nWindermere_16a1 is a Mellow Humic Organic Soil  \nPatua_10a1 is a Typic Impeded Allophanic Soil  \n\n\n==========================================================================================  \n\n**Summmaries, selected properties**  \n  \n| SoilName | RootingDepth | BD_TopLayer | BDMax_AnyLayer | PAW_Top100cm | PAW_Total | KSat_TopLayer | KSatMin_AnyLayer | Carbon_TopLayer | CN2Bare | CNReduction |\n|:-------- | ------------:| -----------:| --------------:| ------------:| ---------:| -------------:| ----------------:| ---------------:| -------:| -----------:|\n|          |         (mm) |     (kg/m³) |        (kg/m³) |         (mm) |      (mm) |        (mm/h) |           (mm/h) |             (%) |     (-) |         (-) |\n| Eyre_23a3 | 710 | 0.841 | 0.841 | 53.5 | 79.5 | 1440 | 1440 | 2.97 | 99.0 | 39.0 |\n| Darnley_4a2 | 700 | 1.254 | 1.388 | 102.0 | 160.0 | 1440 | 1.2 | 3.90 | 89.0 | 20.0 |\n| Waikiwi_33a2 | 2000 | 1.189 | 1.441 | 156.5 | 295.5 | 1440 | 192 | 4.78 | 88.0 | 20.0 |\n| Windermere_16a1 | 2000 | 0.300 | 1.476 | 242.3 | 391.3 | 960 | 192 | 28.65 | 90.0 | 16.0 |\n| Patua_10a1 | 800 | 0.801 | 0.801 | 127.5 | 207.5 | 1920 | 960 | 10.00 | 92.0 | 18.0 |\n| Templeton_1a2 | 2000 | 1.332 | 1.693 | 171.3 | 328.3 | 1440 | 24 | 3.72 | 88.0 | 20.0 |\n| Flaxton_4a1 | 2000 | 1.186 | 1.414 | 171.2 | 405.2 | 1440 | 24 | 5.43 | 93.0 | 16.0 |\n",
                          "Name": "Notes",
                          "ResourceName": null,
                          "Children": [],
                          "Enabled": false,
                          "ReadOnly": false
                        }
