              "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
              "Text": "KIWIFRUIT MANAGEMENT\n\n*\tNZ Kiwifruit harvest season is March - May\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSCENARIO DETAILS\n\n*\tProgressive water stress treatments.\n\n*\tProgressive stress by withholding irrigation monthly  from the end of the irrigation window.\n\n*\tLong-term simulations run continously for 30 years. \n",
